  "solution": "The logic followed here is:\n\n(9, 83, 164)\n\n__**9²**__ + 83 = 164\n\n__**81 + 83**__ = 164\n\n164 = 164 (LHS = RHS)\n\nAnd,\n\n(4, 18, 34)\n\n__42__ + 18 = 34\n\n__16 + 18__ = 34\n\n34 = 34 (LHS = RHS)\n\nSo, checking each option one by one:\n\nOption 1) (6, 38, 74)\n\n__62__ + 38 = 74\n\n__36 + 38__ = 74\n\n**74 = 74 (LHS = RHS)**\n\nOption 2) (5, 27, 56) \n\n__52__ + 27 = 56\n\n__25 + 27__ = 56\n\n52 ≠ 56 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\nOption 3) (11, 122, 242)\n\n__112__ + 122 = 242\n\n__121 + 122__ = 242\n\n243 ≠ 242 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\nOption 4) (13, 167, 334)\n\n__132__ + 167 = 334\n\n__169 + 167__ = 334\n\n336 ≠ 334 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\nThus, out of all the options '(6, 38, 74)' follows the same logic as given.\n\nHence,** \"Option 1\"** is the correct answer.",
